msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE1.NAME"
msgid "上升负荷·眩晕"
msgstr "<color=#C7C74A>Curse of the Abyss: Dizziness</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE1.TOOLTIP"
msgid "第1层「阿比斯之渊」的诅咒：\n\n从浅层返回时出现轻微的眩晕与恶心，注意力难以集中。\n\n压力增加，运动能力下降。"
msgstr "The curse of Layer 1, the Edge of the Abyss:\n\nA faint dizziness and nausea linger after ascending from the shallows.\n\nStress increases and Athletics decreases."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE2.NAME"
msgid "上升负荷·恶心"
msgstr "<color=#F2913D>Curse of the Abyss: Nausea</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE2.TOOLTIP"
msgid "第2层「诱惑之森」的诅咒：\n\n强烈头痛伴随四肢麻木，浑身像被重锤敲打过。\n\n压力增加，运动能力进一步下降，体力恢复减缓。"
msgstr "The curse of Layer 2, the Forest of Temptation:\n\nA pounding headache and numb limbs, as if struck by a hammer.\n\nStress increases, Athletics drops further and Stamina recovers slower."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE3.NAME"
msgid "上升负荷·幻觉"
msgstr "<color=#B04AF2>Curse of the Abyss: Hallucinations</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE3.TOOLTIP"
msgid "第3层「大断层」的诅咒：\n\n剧烈的眩晕中交织着幻视与幻听，分不清现实与深渊的低语。\n\n压力大幅增加，学习、机械操作与建造能力下降。"
msgstr "The curse of Layer 3, the Great Fault:\n\nViolent vertigo entwined with visions and whispers, reality blurring with the voice of the Abyss.\n\nStress increases sharply; Learning, Machinery and Construction decrease."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE4.NAME"
msgid "上升负荷·剧痛"
msgstr "<color=#F44A4A>Curse of the Abyss: Agony</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE4.TOOLTIP"
msgid "第4层「巨人之杯」的诅咒：\n\n全身如同被撕裂般剧痛，七窍渗血。\n\n立即受到 20 点伤害，力量与挖掘能力下降。"
msgstr "The curse of Layer 4, the Goblets of Giants:\n\nA tearing agony throughout the whole body, bleeding from every sense.\n\nImmediately takes 20 damage; Strength and Digging decrease."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE5.NAME"
msgid "上升负荷·感觉剥夺"
msgstr "<color=#4A9BF2>Curse of the Abyss: Sensory Deprivation</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE5.TOOLTIP"
msgid "第5层「亡骸之海」的诅咒：\n\n感觉被深渊一点点夺走，身体不再听从使唤，开始自残或停止思考。\n\n立即受到 30 点伤害，压力急剧增加，运动与学习能力严重下降。"
msgstr "The curse of Layer 5, the Sea of Corpses:\n\nThe Abyss strips away the senses one by one; the body no longer obeys.\n\nImmediately takes 30 damage, stress skyrockets, Athletics and Learning severely decrease."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE6.NAME"
msgid "上升负荷·失去人性"
msgstr "<color=#F2418A>Curse of the Abyss: Loss of Humanity</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSCURSE6.TOOLTIP"
msgid "第6层「最终地」的诅咒：\n\n从最终地上升将受到 80 点伤害，幸存者会被深渊立即重塑为生骸，变成一只随机的小动物；探窟弹药包可以挡下这一次——只受 30 点伤害并损坏掉落。"
msgstr "Ascending from the Capital of the Unreturned deals 80 damage; survivors are at once remade into a Narehate, a random critter. A Delver's Ammo Pouch can ward this off once — taking only 30 damage as the pouch breaks and falls."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSWHISTLEBLUE.NAME"
msgid "苍笛探窟家"
msgstr "<color=#6BD26B>Blue Whistle Delver</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSWHISTLEBLUE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "已抵达「诱惑之森」的证明。\n\n挖掘 +2。"
msgstr "Proof of reaching the Forest of Temptation.\n\nDigging +2."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSWHISTLEMOON.NAME"
msgid "月笛探窟家"
msgstr "<color=#4AD2C7>Moon Whistle Delver</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSWHISTLEMOON.TOOLTIP"
msgid "已抵达「大断层」的证明。\n\n挖掘 +2，运动 +2。"
msgstr "Proof of reaching the Great Fault.\n\nDigging +2, Athletics +2."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSWHISTLEBLACK.NAME"
msgid "黑笛探窟家"
msgstr "<color=#A8A8B8>Black Whistle Delver</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSWHISTLEBLACK.TOOLTIP"
msgid "已抵达「巨人之杯」的证明。\n\n挖掘 +3，运动 +3，力量 +2。"
msgstr "Proof of reaching the Goblets of Giants.\n\nDigging +3, Athletics +3, Strength +2."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSWHISTLEWHITE.NAME"
msgid "白笛探窟家"
msgstr "<color=#FFD24A>White Whistle Delver</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSWHISTLEWHITE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "已抵达「亡骸之海」的传奇证明，深受殖民地敬仰。\n\n挖掘 +5，运动 +5，力量 +3，压力减少。"
msgstr "A legendary proof of reaching the Sea of Corpses, revered across the colony.\n\nDigging +5, Athletics +5, Strength +3, reduced Stress."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSBLESSING.NAME"
msgid "深渊祝福"
msgstr "<color=#7FD4FF>Abyssal Blessing</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSBLESSING.TOOLTIP"
msgid "在「最终地」边缘被弹药包挡下的诅咒，化作了深渊的馈赠。\n\n生命恢复 +30/周期，呼吸恢复 +100 克/秒，压力 -45%/周期。\n\n持续 6 周期，祝福存在期间不会重复获得。深渊的馈赠残留着兽性——部分身体部件会临时变成小动物的样子。"
msgstr "A curse blocked at the edge of the Capital of the Unreturned turns into the Abyss's favor.\n\nHealth +30/cycle, Breath recovery +100 g/s, Stress -45%/cycle.\n\nLasts 6 cycles; a new blessing cannot be gained while it is active. The Abyss's gift carries a trace of bestiality — some body parts temporarily take on the look of small critters."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTDIG.NAME"
msgid "深渊馈赠·掘进"
msgstr "<color=#7FD4FF>Abyssal Gift · Digging</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTDIG.TOOLTIP"
msgid "深渊的馈赠：挖掘 +3。"
msgstr "An Abyssal gift: Digging +3."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTATHLETICS.NAME"
msgid "深渊馈赠·迅捷"
msgstr "<color=#7FD4FF>Abyssal Gift · Athletics</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTATHLETICS.TOOLTIP"
msgid "深渊的馈赠：运动 +3。"
msgstr "An Abyssal gift: Athletics +3."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTSTRENGTH.NAME"
msgid "深渊馈赠·伟力"
msgstr "<color=#7FD4FF>Abyssal Gift · Strength</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTSTRENGTH.TOOLTIP"
msgid "深渊的馈赠：力量 +3。"
msgstr "An Abyssal gift: Strength +3."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTLEARNING.NAME"
msgid "深渊馈赠·敏思"
msgstr "<color=#7FD4FF>Abyssal Gift · Learning</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTLEARNING.TOOLTIP"
msgid "深渊的馈赠：学习 +5。"
msgstr "An Abyssal gift: Learning +5."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTCALM.NAME"
msgid "深渊馈赠·抚慰"
msgstr "<color=#7FD4FF>Abyssal Gift · Soothing</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTCALM.TOOLTIP"
msgid "深渊的馈赠：压力 -10%/周期。"
msgstr "An Abyssal gift: Stress -10%/cycle."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTSTAMINA.NAME"
msgid "深渊馈赠·充沛"
msgstr "<color=#7FD4FF>Abyssal Gift · Vitality</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSGIFTSTAMINA.TOOLTIP"
msgid "深渊的馈赠：体力 +5%/周期。"
msgstr "An Abyssal gift: Stamina +5%/cycle."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSNAREHATE.NAME"
msgid "生骸之躯"
msgstr "<color=#E08BD0>Narehate Body</color>"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.ABYSSNAREHATE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "被深渊重塑过的躯体，衰老得极慢，繁殖力旺盛。\n\n年龄增长 -0.9/周期（老化速度只剩一成），繁殖度 +30%/周期。"
msgstr "A body remade by the Abyss ages extremely slowly and breeds readily.\n\nAge -0.9/cycle (ages at only one tenth the normal rate), Fertility +30%/cycle."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.CREATURES.ATTRIBUTES.AGEDELTA.NAME"
msgid "年龄增长"
msgstr "Aging"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.CREATURES.ATTRIBUTES.AGEDELTA.TOOLTIP"
msgid "生物每个周期增加的年龄。"
msgstr "The age this creature gains per cycle."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_CURSE.NAME"
msgid "上升负荷！"
msgstr "Curse of the Abyss!"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_CURSE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "从深渊上升的复制人正承受着与他们抵达深度相应的诅咒。"
msgstr "A duplicant ascending from the Abyss suffers a curse matching the depth they reached."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_CURSE_FINAL.NAME"
msgid "深渊凝视着你"
msgstr "The Abyss Gazes Back"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_CURSE_FINAL.TOOLTIP"
msgid "复制人从「最终地」开始上升——这可能是他们最后一次作为人类返回。"
msgstr "A duplicant is ascending from the Capital of the Unreturned — this may be the last time they return as a human."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_WHISTLE_PROMOTE.NAME"
msgid "笛级晋升"
msgstr "Whistle Promotion"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_WHISTLE_PROMOTE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "复制人的探窟深度刷新纪录，晋升为更高阶的探窟家。"
msgstr "A duplicant's record diving depth earned them a higher delver whistle rank."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_RELIC_FOUND.NAME"
msgid "深渊遗物！"
msgstr "Relic of the Abyss!"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_RELIC_FOUND.TOOLTIP"
msgid "在深渊中挖掘出了远古的遗物。"
msgstr "An ancient relic was unearthed deep within the Abyss."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_NAREHATE.NAME"
msgid "化为生骸"
msgstr "Became a Narehate"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_NAREHATE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "从「最终地」的诅咒中幸存下来的复制人被深渊重塑，变成了一只生骸。"
msgstr "A duplicant survived the curse of the Capital of the Unreturned, but the Abyss remade their flesh into a Narehate."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.DEATHS.ABYSSCURSE.NAME"
msgid "深渊的诅咒"
msgstr "Curse of the Abyss"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.DEATHS.ABYSSCURSE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "{Target} 的生命被上升负荷夺走，化作了深渊的一部分。"
msgstr "{Target}'s life was claimed by the Curse of the Abyss, becoming part of the depths forever."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.ASSIGNABLE_SLOTS.AMMOPOUCH.NAME"
msgid "弹药包"
msgstr "Ammo Pouch"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.AMMO_POUCH.NAME"
msgid "探窟弹药包"
msgstr "Delver's Ammo Pouch"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.AMMO_POUCH.DESC"
msgid "探窟家的标准装具，鼓鼓囊囊地塞满了备用工具和口粮，内衬的护符散发着微光。\n\n装备后：携带量 +800kg，挖掘 +2。\n\n常驻免疫第 1~2 层（阿比斯之渊/诱惑之森）的上升负荷；从第 4、5、6 层上升（4→3、5→4、6→5）时可挡下一次诅咒，只受 30 点伤害，随后损坏掉落。"
msgstr "Standard issue delver gear, stuffed with spare tools and rations, the talisman lining glimmers faintly.\n\nWhen equipped: Carrying capacity +800kg, Digging +2.\n\nPermanently immune to the Curses of the Abyss from the first two layers; ascending from layers 4, 5 or 6 (4->3, 5->4, 6->5) wards off the curse once — taking only 30 damage as the pouch breaks and falls."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.AMMO_POUCH.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid "为复制人缝制一个探窟弹药包。"
msgstr "Sew an ammo pouch for a duplicant."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.DEATHS.ABYSSNAREHATE.NAME"
msgid "化为生骸"
msgstr "Became a Narehate"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.DEATHS.ABYSSNAREHATE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "{Target} 的血肉被深渊重塑——他们以另一种形态活了下来。"
msgstr "{Target}'s flesh was remade by the Abyss — they live on in another form."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.STATUSITEM_TOOLTIPS.ABYSS_CURSE_DEAD"
msgid "他们不是在打盹——深渊的诅咒带走了他们，让他们化作了深渊的一部分。"
msgstr "They are definitely not napping — the Curse of the Abyss claimed them, and they have become part of the depths."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.STATUSITEM_TOOLTIPS.ABYSS_NAREHATE_DEAD"
msgid "他们不是在打盹——深渊重塑了他们的血肉，他们正以生骸的形态继续活着。"
msgstr "They are definitely not napping — the Abyss remade their flesh, and they live on as a Narehate."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_POUCH_CONSUMED.NAME"
msgid "弹药包损坏"
msgstr "Ammo Pouch Broken"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_POUCH_CONSUMED.TOOLTIP"
msgid "探窟弹药包抵挡了一次上升负荷后损坏，掉落在地。"
msgstr "The ammo pouch broke after warding off a Curse of the Abyss and dropped to the ground."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_BLESSING.NAME"
msgid "深渊的祝福"
msgstr "Blessing of the Abyss"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.ABYSS_BLESSING.TOOLTIP"
msgid "弹药包挡下了「最终地」的诅咒，深渊收回了恶意，转而馈赠祝福。"
msgstr "The ammo pouch warded off the curse of the Capital of the Unreturned; the Abyss withdrew its malice and bestowed a blessing instead."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.ITEMS.AMMO_POUCH_DAMAGED.NAME"
msgid "损坏的弹药包"
msgstr "Broken Ammo Pouch"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.ITEMS.AMMO_POUCH_DAMAGED.DESC"
msgid "内衬的护符在抵挡诅咒时碎裂了。剖开夹层才发现，鼓鼓囊囊塞的哪里是工具和口粮，分明是一坨仍在缓缓搏动的血肉组织——析出的粉红色祈愿培养基还剩 10~15 千克，每 5 秒向外渗漏 1 千克，渗完即止。把它和布料一起送到服装纺织机，还能缝补一新。"
msgstr "The talisman lining shattered while warding off a curse. Slit it open and the bulging padding was never tools or rations at all — it is a lump of flesh, still faintly pulsing, weeping out the last 10-15 kg of pink wishing condensate (1 kg every 5 s, until it runs dry). Take it to the Clothing Fabricator with some fabric to sew it back together."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.AMMO_POUCH.REPAIR_DESC"
msgid "将损坏的弹药包缝补一新。"
msgstr "Sew a broken ammo pouch back into shape."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.ELEMENTS.TALISMANCONDENSATE.NAME"
msgid "祈愿培养基"
msgstr "Wishing Culture Medium"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.ELEMENTS.TALISMANCONDENSATE.DESC"
msgid "入口顺滑，矿物质丰富（铁元素含量爆表），带有淡淡的\"爸爸再爱我一次\"的回甘。粘度适中，比水厚重，比悔恨轻盈\n\n遇热（102°C）沸腾化为祈愿雾气；永不冻结。"
msgstr "Smooth on the palate, rich in minerals (iron content off the charts), with a faint aftertaste of \"Papa, love me again.\" Moderate viscosity — thicker than water, lighter than regret.\n\nBoils at 102 °C into Wishing Vapor; never freezes."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.ELEMENTS.WISHINGVAPOR.NAME"
msgid "祈愿雾气"
msgstr "Wishing Vapor"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.ELEMENTS.WISHINGVAPOR.DESC"
msgid "祈愿培养基沸腾时升起的粉色雾气。吸入无害，但那股香气总让人想起没能实现的愿望。\n\n遇冷（102°C 以下）凝回祈愿培养基。"
msgstr "Pink mist rising from boiling Wishing Culture Medium. Harmless to breathe, but its scent always brings unfulfilled wishes to mind.\n\nCondenses back into Wishing Culture Medium below 102 °C."

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.AMMO_POUCH.GENERICNAME"
msgid "弹药包"
msgstr "Ammo Pouch"
msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.OVERLAYS.ABYSS_LAYERS.LAYER1.NAME"
msgid "第 1 层 阿比斯之渊"
msgstr "Layer 1 · Edge of the Abyss"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.OVERLAYS.ABYSS_LAYERS.LAYER2.NAME"
msgid "第 2 层 诱惑之森"
msgstr "Layer 2 · Forest of Temptation"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.OVERLAYS.ABYSS_LAYERS.LAYER3.NAME"
msgid "第 3 层 大断层"
msgstr "Layer 3 · Great Fault"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.OVERLAYS.ABYSS_LAYERS.LAYER4.NAME"
msgid "第 4 层 巨人之杯"
msgstr "Layer 4 · Goblets of Giants"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.OVERLAYS.ABYSS_LAYERS.LAYER5.NAME"
msgid "第 5 层 亡骸之海"
msgstr "Layer 5 · Sea of Corpses"

msgctxt "MadeInAbyss.STRINGS.OVERLAYS.ABYSS_LAYERS.LAYER6.NAME"
msgid "第 6 层 最终地"
msgstr "Layer 6 · Capital of the Unreturned"

